<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">We also gain other stats based on our raid composition and whilst they have a minor impact on the relative value of our stats, they do not have a maximum amount where they are beneficial like hit rating. This makes it so that those things are less likely to show up or cause us to gear differently.</div></li></ul></div>The recommendations listed below for each gear slot are simply that - <b>recommendations</b>. They have been chosen based on a combination of Spell Power /<wbr/> Crit /<wbr/> Hit /<wbr/> Intellect /<wbr/> Spirit, and we have taken care to provide a range of alternatives. For more specific situations, the <a href="https://discord.gg/8mrt6DE" target="_blank">Classic Warlock Discord</a> maintains a <a href="https://wowsims.github.io/wotlk/warlock/" target="_blank">Gear and DPS Simulator</a> which will help you evaluate the best combination of gear available to you.<div class="clear"></div>
