<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Blue Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40133/purified-dreadstone">
