<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Triumph for Warlock DPS in Phase 3</h3>
<a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a> drop in <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a>. The most important pieces we can buy with <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a> is pieces of <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-176/triumphant-guldans-regalia">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Triumphant Gul'dan's Regalia</span></a>. <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a> is required for the 245-item level version of Tier 9 along with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47242/trophy-of-the-crusade">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_trophy_argent.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Trophy of the Crusade</span></a>. You can also use it for the 232-item level version which only requires <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a>. Generally this isn't recommended due to the share amount of emblems you would require when you start going for the 25-man version as well (you can not upgrade from the 10-man version to the 25-man version with a reduced cost). Additionally, we can use the remaining <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a> we get to update various item slots or get us alternatives to play around with our hit rating. Once you have everything gear related that you want, you can opt to spend any remaining <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a> on <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47556/crusader-orb">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_rune.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crusader Orb</span></a>, the new crafting material that is used to create this phase's bind on equip items.<br/>
<br/>Here is a short list of these items:<br/>
<br/>
<div style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="3" class="grid clean-markup-table-borders" style="width: 75%;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-background="c9" style="width: 20%;">
<b>Rank</b></td>
<td data-background="c9" style="width: 40%;">
<b>Item</b></td>
<td data-background="c9" style="width: 40%;">
<b>Price</b></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>1</td>
<td>
<img alt="" class="no-border" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/icons/horde.png"/> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47804/guldans-hood-of-triumph">
