<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="shoulders">Shoulders</h3>For shoulders, it is a similar story compared to our helm slot. Ideally, we get either <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47793/guldans-shoulderpads-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_35.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gul'dan's Shoulderpads of Triumph</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47807/guldans-shoulderpads-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_35.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gul'dan's Shoulderpads of Triumph</span></a>. Until that time <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46068/amice-of-inconceivable-horror">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_25.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Amice of Inconceivable Horror</span></a> holds up well enough. All other phase 3 shoulders require <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a>, but you might as well save these for the superior <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47807/guldans-shoulderpads-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_35.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gul'dan's Shoulderpads of Triumph</span></a>.<div class="box">
