<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="hands">Hands</h3>If you already have <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45665/pharos-gloves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_61.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pharos Gloves</span></a>, you will notice that it holds up well. However it needs to be combine with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47794/guldans-robe-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_63.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gul'dan's Robe of Triumph</span></a> to achieve your four-piece Tier 9 bonus, and another hit-specific item as you lose out on the hit rating from Tier 9 gloves. Luckily there are plenty of great choices for this such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45133/pendant-of-fiery-havoc">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_31.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pendant of Fiery Havoc</span></a> (which you might already have), <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47205/footpads-of-the-icy-floe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_23.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Footpads of the Icy Floe</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47467/dark-essence-bindings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_32a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dark Essence Bindings</span></a>, and so forth. This combination also frees up one of the heroic chests for someone else. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47487/handwraps-of-the-lifeless-touch">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_56.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Handwraps of the Lifeless Touch</span></a> follows the same pattern and is a close alternative to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45665/pharos-gloves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_61.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pharos Gloves</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>The other (technical BIS) option is spending your <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47557/regalia-of-the-grand-conqueror">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_chain_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Regalia of the Grand Conqueror</span></a> on <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47797/guldans-gloves-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_61.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gul'dan's Gloves of Triumph</span></a> instead of the chest and combining it with one of the heroic chests drops such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47462/skyweaver-vestments">
