<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="waist">Waist</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47419/belt-of-the-tenebrous-mist">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_52.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Tenebrous Mist</span></a> is a direct upgrade over <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45619/starwatchers-binding">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_46.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Starwatcher's Binding</span></a>, note that it is worth going for the socket bonus on this item as you only need a single <span class="socket-blue"></span>blue gem to activate the <span class="q2">7-spell power</span> bonus. Notably this belt also doesn't have hit rating on it, ideal when combined with the hit heavy weapons available this phase.<br/>
<br/>You can increase your hit rating via <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47994/icehowl-binding">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_52.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Icehowl Binding</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47447/belt-of-biting-cold">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_52.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of Biting Cold</span></a> without suffering big penalties to your overall performance. Ideal for people who got their hands on great non-hit items such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47518/mortalis">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_137.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mortalis</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47470/mystifying-charm">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_stratholme_a_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mystifying Charm</span></a>.<div class="box">
<b>Waist Enchant</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41611/eternal-belt-buckle">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_36.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Eternal Belt Buckle</span></a> &amp; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=54793/frag-belt">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Frag Belt</span></a> (<a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=202/engineering">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a>)</div>
