<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="legs">Legs</h3>Ideally, we use a variation of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47795/guldans-leggings-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gul'dan's Leggings of Triumph</span></a> for our four-piece bonus. After the head slot, legs are the second most punishing to forgo, (or the second best to take, depending on how you look at it) in order to achieve your Tier 9 four-piece set bonus. As such it shouldn't be a surprise that all the alternatives perform rather poorly in comparison. The fact that we can choose which slot of Tier we get from vendors makes it so that we have more flexibility to choose our pieces, compared to being at the mercy of loot drops. <br/>
<br/>For non-tier pieces <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47435/pants-of-the-soothing-touch">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pants of the Soothing Touch</span></a> comes closest in terms of performance, it also doesn't have any hit rating just like Tier pants (in other words no additional item swapping is required).  Alternatively, if you need hit rating <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47478/breeches-of-the-deepening-void">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Breeches of the Deepening Void</span></a> would be the go-for option, however in general there are better slots to go for hit rating, such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47467/dark-essence-bindings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_32a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dark Essence Bindings</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47994/icehowl-binding">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_52.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Icehowl Binding</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47205/footpads-of-the-icy-floe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_23.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Footpads of the Icy Floe</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45133/pendant-of-fiery-havoc">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_31.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pendant of Fiery Havoc</span></a>. Note if you don't use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47790/kelthuzads-leggings-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_33.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Kel'Thuzad's Leggings of Triumph</span></a> or any of its relatives that you will need to equip <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47794/guldans-robe-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_63.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gul'dan's Robe of Triumph</span></a> instead to achieve your four-piece bonus. Instead of going for a higher-stat item in the chest slot.<div class="box">
