<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="feet">Feet</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45135/boots-of-fiery-resolution">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_19.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of Fiery Resolution</span></a> from Hard Mode <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=33113/flame-leviathan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Flame Leviathan</span></a> holds up well, only being slightly beaten out by the new best boots <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47454/sandals-of-the-mourning-widow">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_23.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sandals of the Mourning Widow</span></a>. Similarly <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45537/treads-of-the-false-oracle">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Treads of the False Oracle</span></a> the Phase 2 counter part of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45135/boots-of-fiery-resolution">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_19.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of Fiery Resolution</span></a> also remains a good option until we can get any of the 25-man heroic items.<br/>
<br/>If you need hit rating <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47482/boots-of-the-icy-floe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of the Icy Floe</span></a> is a superb option, it performs roughly equal to the technical best in slot setup when combined with a strong non-hit item (such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47518/mortalis">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_137.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mortalis</span></a>). It is one of the best available items out there to play around with hit rating and offers a lot of flexibility as such.<div class="box">
<b>Boot Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=55016/nitro-boosts">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nitro Boosts</span></a> (<a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=202/engineering">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a>) &gt; <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=39006/scroll-of-enchant-boots-tuskarrs-vitality">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_scroll_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scroll of Enchant Boots - Tuskarr's Vitality</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=60623/enchant-boots-icewalker">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Icewalker</span></a></div>
