<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Warlock DPS in Phase 3</h2>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="neck">Neck</h3>Although all the best necklaces this phase come from Hard Modes, they also all are relatively close in terms of overall performance. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47468/cry-of-the-valkyr">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_36.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cry of the Val'kyr</span></a> is the logical successor too phase 2 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45243/sapphire-amulet-of-renewal">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_30naxxramas.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sapphire Amulet of Renewal</span></a>, which on its own also holds up great this phase. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45133/pendant-of-fiery-havoc">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_31.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pendant of Fiery Havoc</span></a> from <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=33113/flame-leviathan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Flame Leviathan</span></a> Hard Mode is still the best option if you can make use of the high amount of hit rating on it.<br/>
<br/>Of note is also those looking to catch up in terms of gearing is that you can get either <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45447/watchful-eye-of-fate">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_45.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Watchful Eye of Fate</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45933/pendant-of-the-shallow-grave">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_46.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pendant of the Shallow Grave</span></a> for only 15 <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=2589/sidereal-essence">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_icediamond_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sidereal Essence</span></span></a>, the new currency rewarded for completing Heroic++ Dungeons.<div class="pad"></div>
