<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="trinkets">Trinkets</h3>The best two trinkets remain <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45518/flare-of-the-heavens">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonlightwell.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flare of the Heavens</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45466/scale-of-fates">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_spiritshard_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scale of Fates</span></a>. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45466/scale-of-fates">
