<span class="tinyicontxt">Ulduar</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>A lot of us might already have <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40432/illustration-of-the-dragon-soul">
