<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_burningspirit.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Life Tap</span></a> to maintain full stacks of the buff, even outside of combat. This makes it essentially a static trinket providing 200 spell power. Doing so makes it perform similarly to the normal version of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47316/reign-of-the-dead">
