<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="weapons">Weapons and Offhands for Warlock DPS in Phase 3</h2>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="2-handed-weapons">2-Handed Weapons</h3>Unfortunately for staff fans, one-handers with an offhand have historically been the stronger option. Phase 3 is no exception for this, even if you combine it with the stronger two-hand enchant <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45056/scroll-of-enchant-staff-greater-spellpower">
