<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="1-handed-weapons">1-Handed Weapons</h3>When it comes to one-hand options there are a lot greater choices. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47422/barb-of-tarasque">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_93.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Barb of Tarasque</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47518/mortalis">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_137.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mortalis</span></a> are the best options out there, both perform similarly under different circumstances, this in turn gives us a lot of flexibility this phase when it comes to gearing. For most gear slots there are great hit options and non-hit options, nearly any of these combinations will result in performance close to the technical best in slot setup. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47518/mortalis">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_137.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mortalis</span></a> is the go-to weapon if you are using one of these hit items somewhere in your setup, alternatively if you do not have any hit items equipped aside from in your weapon slots you should opt for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47422/barb-of-tarasque">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_93.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Barb of Tarasque</span></a> given the choice. <br/>
<br/>Alternatively for those great in Arena <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49191/relentless-gladiators-blade-of-celerity">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_pvp320_c_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relentless Gladiator's Blade of Celerity</span></a> is another great viable option, note that once again this weapon doesn't provide us with any hit rating, so refer to the slots mentioned above for alternative items to use to reach hit cap.<br/>
<br/>Whilst <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45620/starshard-edge">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_92.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Starshard Edge</span></a> was quite the jewel last phase and it will do great seeing you through phase three, you will want to eventually upgrade it, if possible, the new heroic 25-man options just are too great. Sadly, all other of the new weapons perform slightly worse compared too <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45620/starshard-edge">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_92.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Starshard Edge</span></a>, so whilst there are upgrades available there aren't that many choices either.<div class="box">
<b>Weapon Enchant</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44467/scroll-of-enchant-weapon-mighty-spellpower">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_scroll_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scroll of Enchant Weapon - Mighty Spellpower</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=59625/enchant-weapon-black-magic">
