<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="offhand">Offhand</h3>Like a lot of our gear slots this phase, the offhand slot gives us a lot of great options to explore and use. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48032/lightbane-focus">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_stratholme_a_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightbane Focus</span></a> is the best option providing hit rating, however <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47437/talisman-of-heedless-sins">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_stratholme_a_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Talisman of Heedless Sins</span></a> from <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=34780/lord-jaraxxus">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Lord Jaraxxus</span></a> is a real close second. Those lucky that got <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45617/cosmos">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_ulduarraid_d_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cosmos</span></a> in phase 2 won't be seeing the biggest upgrades in terms of offhands due to how well it keeps performing.<br/>
<br/>Say you got one of the hit rating options in another slot, the offhand slot is another great place to consider using an item without hit rating without sacrificing performance. Most notable is the heroic <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47470/mystifying-charm">
